🧾 Project Description

This phase extends the previously approved CIB UDL platform implementation to enable the Codify the Bank (CTB) use case to progress towards production by integrating with enterprise knowledge and AI capabilities.

The focus of this phase is to:

* integrate with the on-premise Neo4j enterprise knowledge graph platform
* enable AI model access via the Group AI platform
* support the generation and consumption of structured knowledge from processed documents

This establishes the foundation for CTB to evolve from a document processing capability into an enterprise-aligned knowledge platform.

